X: 1
T: The Kingdom Satan Founded
C: Words: Thomas Hansen Kingo, 1689. Translated by Carl Døving, 1908.
C: Music: 'Au Meines Herzens Grunde' or 'I Døden Jesus Blunded' or 'Jeg Vil Din Pris Udsjunge', David Wolder, 1598.
C: Setting: "The Lutheran Hymnary", 1913.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2025 Revision.
S: Music and Lyrics source: "The Lutheran Hymnary", 1913 Hymn 280
S: Note that this tune has at least two variants, wherein not only the setting but the melody changes a bit.
S: This seems to be the more typical version of the tune.
M: 4/4 % time signature
L: 1/4 % default length
