%% 6.\t\tGod, let not love of sinning Thy fear drive from my breast, 
%% \t\t\tLest Satan, triumph winning, Be of my heart possessed; 
%% \t\t\tO let Thy chas'tning rod Each day give me direction, 
%% \t\t\tTo seek Thy sure protection And tell Thy grace abroad. 
%%endtext
