%% 7.\t\tMy heart must Thou have solely, My Savior and my God! 
%% \t\t\tCome, Jesus, take it wholly, And make it Thine abode! 
%% \t\t\tMold it to Thy control, That I, Thy Word receiving, 
%% \t\t\tMay find, in Thee believing, Salvation for my soul. 
%%endtext
